      <tei:div type="colophon" subtype="introduction">
        <tei:p>Traditionally each cup in the Passover Seder is liked to a promise made by God in these verses, Exodus 6:6-7. The four cups can also be associated with the Four Freedoms first articulated by US President Franklin D. Roosevelt on January 6, 1941, which were an inspiration for the Universal Declaration of Human Rights and were explicitly incorporated into its preamble.</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
      <j:endConditional target="#osp_8785_introduction"/>
